{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"alias":"feminist-timeless-primate","creation_channel":"cli","description":"Consolidate the code review bot's per-criterion Opus passes (currently 7 sequential passes over full change context per review) into batched criteria passes, mirroring the batching plan review already uses. Expected to reduce both per-review cost and peak-day aggregate spend. Acceptance: reviews produce equivalent verdicts on the gold set; per-review token usage measurably reduced; unit-cost dashboard reflects the change.","id":"bdcf-13cd-07e1-4c03","parent_id":"887c-009e-bc96-48c8","priority":2,"tags":["cost"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Batch code-review criteria into consolidated passes"},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1789406133268656001,"uuid":"5d6871c1-b0b1-42be-af8f-85f51ca3933f"}